## Innovation Process

### Stage-Gate Process

| Stage | Gate | Decision |
|-------|------|----------|
| Ideation | Concept Review | Fund exploration? |
| Exploration | Feasibility Gate | Fund development? |
| Development | Validation Gate | Fund scale-up? |
| Scale-up | Launch Gate | Launch product? |
| Launch | Post-Launch Review | Continue/pivot/stop? |

### Governance

| Body | Role | Cadence |
|------|------|---------|
| Innovation Council | Strategy, portfolio | Quarterly |
| Technology Review Board | Technical decisions | Monthly |
| Business Review | Commercial readiness | Stage-gates |
| Division R&D Leads | Execution | Weekly |

